      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIPPED RACCOON (6) is a consistent runner who is having his first look at course. Strong winner last time by 1.75 lengths at Taree Super Track in NG in one of the quickest times on the program (17.20). Well placed and will be tough to beat. FLORIDA LINE (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 4 lengths away in second (18.26) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 320m. Overdue and expected to feature again. I'M BORED (2) has not raced since scoring (18.69) over 320m at this track three-and-a-half months ago. Has performed well from this box. This looks easier and expected to run well. MEPUNGA SHINE (3) was below best last time at Bulli (23.79) in a Mix 1/2/3, finishing a 21 length eighth. Has already won out of this draw.",
